   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Positions are nouns",
     "texto": [
      "In Japanese, «on top», «underneath» or «inside» are **nouns**, and they link to the object with **の**: **テーブル の うえ** (on the table; literally «the top of the table»).",
      "The order is the reverse of English: first the object, then the position.",
      "To say where something is: **A は B の うえ に あります** (A is on top of B)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
